<title>POLAND: Polish shares close higher in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close higher in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stalexport and Universal closed higher, one stock closed lower and one was flat in Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Thursday. Six stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>Total turnover was 1.2 million zlotys, down from Wednesday's 2.4 million zlotys.</p>
<p>NFI units rose 7.3 percent to 133 zlotys in a record turnover of 17.7 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
